{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1795152541497693002,"compiled_state":{"alias":"geode-objective-salamander","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"c74489e7993e2fad5e90aca4c32a8b1abe1437adedf567e7be32ef15b7251714","event_uuid":"05e63d22-c5d2-4b54-8257-6212ee1129a1","position":{"commit_sha":"3481d5dc7a7cb955abbce3fd7960d49035795a1a","position":"1795152495719694001-05e63d22-c5d2-4b54-8257-6212ee1129a1"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIMQNvvCya66a6YyDlxwkxjjJPN3uaFI+QD3OjyC8e1UF rebar-mac-492a5c71 joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com 20261119"},{"content_hash":"da41d070da820a7592ddd7cc9ac70caa61064549d87a98d383f3f7012af0b1ca","event_uuid":"6915d179-a76d-4184-b095-08ea67e97d2a","position":{"commit_sha":"39b2035ed3aff6d20216cfadcfe40fd3f6f09718","position":"1795152541497693001-6915d179-a76d-4184-b095-08ea67e97d2a"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIMQNvvCya66a6YyDlxwkxjjJPN3uaFI+QD3OjyC8e1UF rebar-mac-492a5c71 joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com 20261119"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1795152495719694001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"6915d179-a76d-4184-b095-08ea67e97d2a","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"7fcc-dac7-6f05-4ad1"}],"description":"## Observation\nOn 2026-11-19 at about 20:57 PST (load average 42.97/43.57/41.22 on the shared agent host), a targeted pytest run in worktree fix-test-git-maint-detach (73 tests, -n 4) reported 72 passed and 1 error: tests/unit/test_topology_template_upkeep_guard.py::test_a_partially_pinned_repository_is_still_refused errored in teardown with subprocess.TimeoutExpired from tests/_isolation.py head() (git -C <worktree> rev-parse HEAD, 5 s watchdog, re-sampled GIT_PROBE_ATTEMPTS times). The test body passed.\n\nClosed bug dominating-removable-monkfish measured the same probe (p99 2.08 s, max 3.30 s under 18 processes x 100 probes) and closed with an environment-or-config disposition. This is the same symptom at a higher load than that measurement covered.\n\n## Hypotheses (unproven)\n- Process-spawn and scheduler saturation at load ~43 pushes all re-sampled probes past 5 s.\n- Contention on the shared checkout's object store or index from concurrent agent sessions.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Probe latency is measured at a load comparable to 40+ and the outcome is recorded here.\n- [ ] Either the guard tolerates that load without a false teardown error (with a regression test), or the ticket records why the current bound is kept.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"beef-0e12-6db9-491d","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Repo-isolation HEAD watchdog still errors a passing test at host load ~43","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["05e63d22-c5d2-4b54-8257-6212ee1129a1","6915d179-a76d-4184-b095-08ea67e97d2a"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1795152541497693002,"uuid":"618a94c9-45d2-48b0-be67-9c5a653ddbee"}
